Explanation: repo.jellyfin.org may supply jellyfin-ffmpeg8 and nothing else. A record naming
Explanation: the package outranks a Package: * record whatever their order (apt_preferences(5)).
Package: *
Pin: origin "repo.jellyfin.org"
Pin-Priority: -1

Package: jellyfin-ffmpeg8
Pin: origin "repo.jellyfin.org"
Pin-Priority: 500
